; Sized to cover the 12 x 15 grid below (about 550 x 750 m of city, laid from
; front_z into -Z) with room to turn around at either end. The collision under
; it is an infinite WorldBoundaryShape3D regardless, so this plane is only ever
; a visual hem - but a hem you can see is a hem you fly toward.
